From 797588b03c4fda8932437a6e30bb42ca8251ea72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:16:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Event-locations section flag + Twilio SMS status callback

Product Builder sections can now be shown at event locations WITHOUT appearing
in the normal menus:
- New 'Event locations' tick box beside a section's Top menu / Footer toggles.
  With it on (and Top/Footer off), the section is tagged eventOnly: it's built
  into the menu but hidden everywhere except a store whose 'Event menu' list
  names it. This is what lets a curated 'Events' coffee section exist without
  cluttering the main menu.
- /api/menu hides eventOnly sections at normal stores; an event store's section
  allowlist surfaces the named ones and treats them as primary nav.
- The event-store 'Event menu' and free-category pickers now list Product
  Builder section names too, so 'Events' is selectable there.

Also: /api/twilio/status endpoint (form-encoded) records SMS delivery statuses
in memory for the admin, so an alphanumeric-sender Status callback URL has
somewhere to POST. https://app.beanculture.com.au/api/twilio/status

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
